 &lt;h2 id="installation-and-configuration"
 &gt;
 Installation and Configuration
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/help/faq/#installation-and-configuration" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: Installation and Configuration" aria-label="Anchor to: Installation and Configuration" href="#installation-and-configuration"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
 &lt;h3 id="how-do-i-configure-tcps-for-oracle-databases"
 &gt;
 How do I configure TCPS for Oracle databases?
 &lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/help/faq/#how-do-i-configure-tcps-for-oracle-databases" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: How do I configure TCPS for Oracle databases?" aria-label="Anchor to: How do I configure TCPS for Oracle databases?" href="#how-do-i-configure-tcps-for-oracle-databases"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install &lt;code&gt;sqlnet.ora&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tnsnames.ora&lt;/code&gt; from the template files.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Glossary</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/help/glossary/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/help/glossary/</guid><description>&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
 &lt;h3 id="migration"
 &gt;
 Migration
 &lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/help/glossary/#migration" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: Migration" aria-label="Anchor to: Migration" href="#migration"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A migration is the top-most differentiation within the CYBERTEC Migrator.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Requirements</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/requirements/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 15:27:44 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/requirements/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CYBERTEC Migrator&lt;/em&gt; is distributed as a set of &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="https://github.com/opencontainers/image-spec/blob/main/spec.md"
&gt;container images&lt;/a&gt; that are managed with the help of &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="https://docs.docker.com/compose/"
&gt;Docker Compose&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link--code"
 href="https://docs.docker.com/get-docker/"
&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;code&gt;podman&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link--code"
 href="https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/"
&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker compose&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 2.0.0&lt;/code&gt;) or &lt;code&gt;podman-compose&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 2.20.1&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;bash&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 4.0&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Online</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/installation/online/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/installation/online/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CYBERTEC Migrator&lt;/em&gt; can be installed using either &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Podman&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The docker images are available on the &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="https://containers.cybertec.at/"
&gt;Cybertec Container Image Registry&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="#contact"
&gt;get in touch with us&lt;/a&gt; if your account has not been granted access to the respective images.
Make sure you are logged in the Docker Hub registry with the correct user.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cat ~/password.txt &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;docker, podman&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; login containers.cybertec.at --username &amp;lt;username&amp;gt; --password-stdin
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clone this git repository&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change working directory to the previously cloned repository&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the installer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start the Migrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ git clone https://github.com/cybertec-postgresql/cybertec_migrator
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ &lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; cybertec_migrator
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ ./migrator install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; You are about to be asked to enter some information relevant to the installation.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; The allowed values are in normal brackets, the default value in square brackets.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Migrator Edition &lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;trial, professional, enterprise&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;trial&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Container runtime &lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;docker, podman&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;docker&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Generating environment file
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Pulling container images &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; trial:v3.20.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Generating self-signed TLS/SSL certificate
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;OK&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Install finished. To start the CYBERTEC Migrator, run ./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ ./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_core_db_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_core_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_web_gui_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;OK&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Started on &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;https://localhost&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Online</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/upgrade/online/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/upgrade/online/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class="gdoc-hint warning"&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__title flex gap-8 align-center"&gt;&lt;i class="fa warning"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;Warning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__text"&gt;Running migrations &lt;em&gt;will&lt;/em&gt; be interrupted by applying upgrades.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgrade to newest version&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restart the Migrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./migrator upgrade
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Offline</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/installation/offline/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 15:28:36 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/installation/offline/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The offline installation package for the &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/products/cybertec-migrator#form"
&gt;Trial Edition&lt;/a&gt; may be downloaded for free.
For the Professional or Enterprise Edition, please &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="#contact"
&gt;get in touch with us&lt;/a&gt; to request access to our download server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract the provided archive file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change working directory to newly created directory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the installer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start the Migrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ tar xf cybertec_migrator-trial-v3.20.0.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ &lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; cybertec_migrator
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ ./migrator install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; You are about to be asked to enter some information relevant to the installation.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; The allowed values are in normal brackets, the default value in square brackets.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Migrator Edition &lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;trial, professional, enterprise&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;trial&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Container runtime &lt;span class="o"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;docker, podman&lt;span class="o"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;docker&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Generating environment file
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Loading container images
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;INFO&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Generating self-signed TLS/SSL certificate
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;OK&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Install finished. To start the CYBERTEC Migrator, run ./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;➜ ./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_core_db_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_core_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Recreating cybertec_migrator_web_gui_1 ... &lt;span class="k"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;OK&lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; Started on &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;https://localhost&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Offline</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/upgrade/offline/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/upgrade/offline/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class="gdoc-hint warning"&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__title flex gap-8 align-center"&gt;&lt;i class="fa warning"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;Warning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__text"&gt;Running migrations &lt;em&gt;will&lt;/em&gt; be interrupted by applying upgrades.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;




&lt;blockquote class="gdoc-hint tip"&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__title flex gap-8 align-center"&gt;&lt;i class="fa tip"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;Tip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="gdoc-hint__text"&gt;Installation archives also serve for upgrading the Migrator.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgrade to version bundled in archive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restart Migrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./migrator upgrade --archive cybertec_migrator-edition-vX.Y.Z.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./migrator up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Usage</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/usage/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 15:28:36 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/getting-started/usage/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Use your web browser to access the Migrator on the URL shown in the terminal with &lt;code&gt;./migrator up&lt;/code&gt;. In our example it would be &lt;code&gt;https://localhost&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The configuration provided with this repository starts the CYBERTEC Migrator on the standard HTTPS port.
The &lt;code&gt;EXTERNAL_HTTP_PORT&lt;/code&gt; variable in the &lt;code&gt;.env&lt;/code&gt; file (generated by &lt;code&gt;./migrator install&lt;/code&gt;) controls the choice of port on which the Migrator is served.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don&amp;rsquo;t have access to an Oracle or PostgreSQL database to test the Migrator, check out our &lt;a
 class="gdoc-markdown__link"
 href="https://github.com/cybertec-postgresql/cybertec_migrator_demo"
&gt;Migrator demo database environment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Supported Features</title><link>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/features/oracle/supported-features/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jul 2024 09:12:43 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/features/oracle/supported-features/</guid><description>&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
 &lt;h2 id="database-object-types"
 &gt;
 Database Object Types
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://cybertec-postgresql.github.io/cybertec_migrator/features/oracle/supported-features/#database-object-types" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: Database Object Types" aria-label="Anchor to: Database Object Types" href="#database-object-types"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;CREATE&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Comment&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
